00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:35.910
Yes.

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:37.450
We're off.

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:40.760
Ms. Hikaru, please take
care of everyone in the castle.

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:10.250
Cephiro.

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:13.120
It's mostly gone now...

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:17.860
...but if there's a Pillar, it's
a beautiful country of eternal spring.

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:27.410
Cephiro, the country of magic.

00:17:27.510 --> 00:17:30.940
I will make sure that I,
Tarta of Chizeta, will own it.

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:34.940
And so I'm making a serious vow...

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:38.710
How long do you intend
to be giggling, Tatra?

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:40.680
But just look.

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:44.620
It's so cute.

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:53.520
My, and I braided them in for you too.

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:54.930
Whatcha doin'?

00:17:56.070 --> 00:17:57.830
Tarta, your accent.

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:02.230
Do you understand, Sister?

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:07.370
We promised Father and Mother
we would make Cephiro our territory.

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:10.110
I remember, Tarta.

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:14.150
Because our country,
Chizeta, is really small...

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:18.690
...we wanted to expand our territory
by becoming the Pillar of Cephiro.

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:20.560
Exactly!

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:25.890
W-What's that?

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:27.260
Oh my!

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:29.370
They seem tough.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:31.700
It seems we may lose.

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:36.270
Let's go, Sister.
We have to see what they're like.

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:38.610
Go where?

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:42.170
Those are most likely
the legendary Rune-Gods of Cephiro!

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:43.580
Right, right.

00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:47.550
I want to see how powerful
they are by using my spirit!

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:48.810
Good luck!

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:50.410
There are two of them!

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:51.330
Yes.

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:53.050
Yes.
Get yours out too!

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:56.530
My, are you lonely
doing it by yourself, Tarta?

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:58.190
It's not that!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.430
You're so dependent...

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:31.860
Appear, our guardian spirits...

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:35.390
Djinn!

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:45.770
What? It's starting to glow!

00:19:46.510 --> 00:19:48.280
Ms. Umi, be careful.

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:04.190
What are those disgusting things?

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:12.930
Fuu!

00:20:32.890 --> 00:20:37.420
Water Dragon!

00:20:45.940 --> 00:20:47.340
Gross!

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:00.550
D-Disgusting.

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:03.090
What are they, Sang Yung?

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:05.820
The djinn
of the princesses of Chizeta.

00:21:05.930 --> 00:21:06.760
Gin?

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:08.920
Djinn! They are spirits.

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:11.330
What are these things called djinn?

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:13.230
Something like knights.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.830
I wouldn't want
knights in such bad taste.

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:26.840
Umi...

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:28.340
Fuu...

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:35.750
Debonair.

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:43.360
That woman...

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:46.690
...was born from Cephiro?

00:22:17.960 --> 00:22:23.370
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:31.310
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:38.310
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:42.820
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:43.190 --> 00:22:45.560
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:47.390 --> 00:22:50.690
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:51.060 --> 00:22:54.400
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:54.840 --> 00:23:01.740
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:23:02.180 --> 00:23:05.580
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:05.910 --> 00:23:14.340
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:17.190 --> 00:23:20.520
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:20.760 --> 00:23:28.830
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:30.900 --> 00:23:37.710
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:46.290 --> 00:23:48.080
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:48.590 --> 00:23:52.550
The third enemy, Chizeta,
has now arrived in Cephiro.

00:23:52.830 --> 00:23:55.350
Umi and Fuu
headed out to stop them...

00:23:55.460 --> 00:23:57.990
...but guardian spirits
blocked their path.

00:23:58.100 --> 00:24:02.300
Since I can't call my Rune-God,
I can only watch the other two fight.

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:04.430
Do your best, Umi, Fuu!

00:24:04.940 --> 00:24:06.840
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:06.940 --> 00:24:09.340
Umi and Fuu & Fahren and Chizeta.

00:24:09.440 --> 00:24:09.710
Umi and Fuu & Fahren and Chizeta

00:24:09.710 --> 00:24:11.710
Umi and Fuu & Fahren and Chizeta
You have to watch it!

00:24:11.710 --> 00:24:13.450
Umi and Fuu & Fahren and Chizeta

00:24:13.450 --> 00:24:20.380
Who is it today?

00:24:21.460 --> 00:24:23.360
Today, it's Fuu!

00:24:23.460 --> 00:24:24.420
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:24.420 --> 00:24:27.230
Look forward to the next episode!
Everyone, did you guess correctly?

00:24:27.230 --> 00:24:29.420
Look forward to the next episode!
Till next time!
